<title>SPAIN: S&amp;P's affirms AA- rating for Balearic Islands.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P's affirms AA- rating for Balearic Islands.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's rating agency on Tuesday affirmed its AA- long-term rating for the Balearic Islands and said its outlook was stable.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating reflects the good financial position of the regional government as well as its moderate level of debt and investment,&quot; Standard &amp; Poor's said in a statement.</p>
<p>The agency said it expected the regional government's self-financing ratio to remain at high levels and the debt ratio to continue decreasing.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
